sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Application
    participant Rt as Router
    participant M as Master partition
    participant S as Slave replica
    participant Bin as Change log
    participant Bk as Backup store
    App->>Rt: write
    Rt->>M: route by partition key
    M->>Bin: append to the change log
    M->>S: replicate
    S-->>M: ack
    M-->>App: committed
    loop scheduled
        Bk->>M: take a consistent snapshot
        Bin->>Bk: ship the log segments since that snapshot
    end
    Note over Bk: restore point = snapshot + replayed log — the gap is the RPO
    alt master fails
        Rt->>S: promote and redirect writes
    end
